WEBVTT

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.110
I did it! I played it!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.110
<i>I did it!</i>

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.440
<i>I did it!</i>

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.250
<i>I'm so happy, Yuzu!</i>

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:28.920
Fly!

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:36.690
Alice.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.640
I'll tell you.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.360
Before you see Momo...

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:43.570
I'll tell you!

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.760
<i>The music video was very well received.</i>

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:47.770
Is that right?

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:51.270
<i>Momo, do you dislike In NO Hurry?</i>

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.030
<i>Or is it that you dislike 
them taking Arisugawa-san?</i>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:56.280
Don't ask me stupid questions.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.360
<i>You should just go see her one more time.</i>

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.150
I don't intend to ever—

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:07.360
<i>I sleep in the depths of sweet nectar</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.750
<i>When I sing, that alone makes me wonderful</i>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:09.920
<i>Yuzu, I can play it.</i>

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:11.500
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.640
<i>Hurry.</i>

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.930
<i>So let me stay here in this cage</i>

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:16.490
<i>Hurry.</i>

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.410
<i>I want to see you.</i>

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:23.430
<i>When I shout, that alone makes me invincible</i>

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>Momo!</i>

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.440
<i>So please don't open this cage</i>

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:44.340
Alice!

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.210
Momo.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:07.810
Momo! Don't move an inch!

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.370
♭08 I Will Be Your Friend, I Swear I Will

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.420
Didn't I just tell you to stay put?

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:58.380
I see no reason why I need to listen to you.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.240
I'm sorry about what 
happened at the audition.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.630
Also, thanks for the guitar.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.590
Anyway, what are you doing here?

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.890
Hey, Momo, after—

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.610
Don't talk to me again.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.410
You're in the light music club, right?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.370
I forgot.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.480
So you're the one who gave 
her that "Alice" nickname?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.380
That's really fitting. Alice—

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:32.300
Stop it.

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.420
I'm the only one who gets to call her that.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.080
So this is it, Yuzuriha.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:50.930
Alice.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.420
<i>Don't talk to you again?</i>

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.080
<i>That's impossible.</i>

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:57.960
<i>It's just impossible.</i>

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:05.450
<i>There are so many things I want to say to you.</i>

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.160
<i>They're overflowing.</i>

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.680
<i>Even now, I feel like I'll scream them out.</i>

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.090
What do I do?

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.540
What do I do, Yuzu?

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.260
Momo has been...

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.960
so close to me all along.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.220
It feels like a lie! I can't believe it!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.540
I must be dreaming.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.440
I'm even happy that he was so cold 
to me and said, "Don't talk to me."

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.430
Even him glaring at me and getting 
angry at me makes me happy!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.320
Calm down, Alice!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.610
Oh, yeah, Yuzu. Didn't you 
have something to say to me?

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:43.410
It... doesn't matter anymore.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.050
I can see Momo!

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:48.480
Wait, Alice! Did you take off your shoes first?!

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.720
I did!

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.620
Good!

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.280
I wonder what class he's in.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.620
That's the special class 
building. He's in Class S.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.870
<i>I want to tell him.</i>

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:03.060
<i>About how sad I was when he went away.</i>

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:05.860
<i>I want to tell him.</i>

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.970
<i>That I believed he'd come back one day,</i>

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:13.010
<i>and that's why I chose a school in Yokohama.</i>

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.010
<i>I want to tell him.</i>

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.520
<i>That I always sang because</i>

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.980
<i>I wanted him to hear me.</i>

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:21.930
<i>And...</i>

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:34.470
I'm coming in.

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.380
It's unusual for you to have such a hard time.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:43.590
It's because I met Nino.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:48.560
Didn't I tell you? That if I met her, 
I wouldn't be able to write anymore.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.350
And why is that, anyway?

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:53.760
You're the one who wants 
to start writing for her again.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.690
Didn't you choose a school 
with a strong chorus club

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:00.140
because you hoped to see her again?

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:05.060
If you have something you want to tell her 
or something you want to do with her,

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.650
why don't you just tell her?

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.070
If you want your dream to come true, that is.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.330
My dream...

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.470
Incoming Call 
Mom

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:36.910
Hello.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.470
<i>And</i>

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.170
<i>that now, just like then,</i>

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.920
<i>I still</i>

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.440
<i>like him.</i>

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:50.410
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:52.870
Because you told me not to talk to you.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.550
Forget about that for now.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:56.680
Do you have some time?

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.120
I want to talk.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.700
Come on, let's go.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.000
Are you listening?

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:25.290
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:29.150
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.190
<i>my chance to tell him everything?</i>

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.110
Sorry.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:36.780
Huh?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.070
Sorry.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:38.800
Huh?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.670
Sorry.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.790
For how I treated you at the audition.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:45.030
Oh... Yeah.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:46.990
That's all?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:47.960
There's more.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:50.490
Six years ago...

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:53.640
Sorry for disappearing 
without saying anything.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:54.650
Yeah.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:59.080
Also, sorry for borrowing some 
music and never returning it.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.290
Yeah.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.540
Also,

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:04.390
I...

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:07.250
Six years ago,

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.200
I liked you.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.580
I wanted to tell you that right here, 
on the day of the fireworks show.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:28.760
But I was so shy, something else came out.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.130
I hope, one day, we can 
use your song as a guide

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.340
to find each other again.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.130
You used to...

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.090
like me.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:42.380
Yeah. I finally told you.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:43.600
Momo—

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.750
But the person I like now...

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:49.200
I hate to admit it, but she 
pushed me to keep going.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.810
<i>Wait.</i>

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.820
<i>Wait.</i>

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.880
<i>Even now...</i>

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.580
<i>Even now...</i>

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:08.120
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:12.630
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:12.630
Seriously, learn to listen when 
someone's talking to you.

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:17.830
<i>Up above the world so high</i>

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:22.660
<i>Like a diamond in the sky</i>

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:27.450
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:31.650
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:32.820
<i>I want to tell him.</i>

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:37.030
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.300
<i>That I've been lonely all this time.</i>

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.660
<i>That I always wanted to see him again.</i>

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:41.660
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.010
<i>That I always wanted to sing with him again.</i>

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:46.160
<i>And I hope that our song</i>

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.750
<i>And that even now...</i>

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:51.440
<i>Will reach out to everyone</i>

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.890
<i>Now and forever,</i>

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:56.170
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.290
<i>that you're the one...</i>

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:54.790
<i>You're the one...</i>

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.170
<i>You're the one!</i>

00:10:56.170 --> 00:11:01.160
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.570
Momo, you've gotten even worse.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:09.180
No one asked you.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.190
I have something I've 
always wanted to say, too.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.300
Six years ago,

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:19.190
I used to...

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.080
like you, too.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.080
I know.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.470
<i>I...</i>

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.460
<i>lied to Momo</i>

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.700
<i>for the first time today.</i>

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.930
Momo, let's hold hands.

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.180
No way.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:46.930
Listen when I say something.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.540
What's the harm?

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.660
I won't talk to you from 
tomorrow onward.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:52.940
Only as far as the station.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:56.770
<i>Now I'll never be able to tell him.</i>

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.910
<i>Now I have no choice but to hide</i>

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.600
<i>how I truly feel.</i>

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.370
Nino, what about your guitar?

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.260
Lately, you've made sure to take it every day.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.330
It's fine.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.320
I'm off.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.340
It's been a while

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.860
since I saw her make a face like that.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.470
Here.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.390
Demos of twelve songs for the album.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.330
Seriously? So quick!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.560
I've already given the others copies.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.470
I want to start recording this weekend.

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:37.400
Got it.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.360
Are those the black cats?

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.580
Yeah. They've put out more than I realized.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.860
The fight's on now, seriously.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:46.580
Doesn't matter to me.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:49.710
We're us.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.000
Sounds good.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:57.120
Morning, Yuzu.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.070
M-Morning, Alice.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.850
All the songs for the album were amazing.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.880
O-Of course.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.050
You'd better get ready for 
some serious practice.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:13.600
I'm going to take a little 
break from the guitar.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.100
I'd like to put singing 
practice first for now.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.770
Alice, you seem to be smiling a lot.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:21.250
Is it because Momo's so close?

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:22.990
Yep.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.990
Nurse's Office

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.870
Oh, my! What a coincidence.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.920
It's pretty unusual to see 
you in the nurse's office.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.240
Did you drink so much milk 
that it made you sick?

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.630
It's just a headache! A headache!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:45.600
Oh, gosh! Isn't that a sign that you're 
about to have a growth spurt?

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.120
Let's celebrate tonight.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:49.710
Leave my height out of this!

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:52.370
And why are you here? What's wrong with you?

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:55.640
I'm also here for a plain old headache.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.650
You know what, Haruyoshi?

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.650
I'm brokenhearted.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:07.700
So you finally admit you're in love with her?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.230
Shut up.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.680
So? Why are you brokenhearted?

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.050
Did you tell her how you feel?

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:17.040
The guy she likes feels 
the same way about her.

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:19.540
She was supposed to belong only to me.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.300
I feel like it's only a matter of 
time until they get together.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.550
Really?

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:28.880
She's been smiling so much.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.890
She looked... r-really cute.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:40.630
Somewhere deep down, I believed that 
one day, she'd definitely fall for me.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:43.730
Hey!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.360
Sorry, sorry. It's not what you think.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.070
What's not what I think?

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.520
I just thought you're amazing.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:51.660
Amazing?

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:56.210
Saying you "believed" it means you 
found out you were wrong, right?

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.450
And putting that into words 
takes a lot of courage.

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:02.130
So I thought it was pretty manly.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:07.320
Hopefully, one day, your height 
will match how manly you are.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.090
Can I strangle you?

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.720
No way!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.850
There's still a lot I haven't done yet.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.310
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:26.910
Looks good! Your new costumes are perfect.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:29.000
Huh? Where's Nino?

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:30.360
Sorry for the wait.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.860
Yuzu-kun, don't stare.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.130
Huh?! I wasn't staring!

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.690
Does it look bad.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:52.550
I didn't say that!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:54.550
Great.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.310
Okay, looks like we're set on appearances.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.210
Um, there's something I want to 
talk to you about with regard

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.980
to how I move during the music video.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.650
Nino-chan, you're really into this.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.440
Well, I want to make it into something great!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.030
Just don't go on camera 
with that look on your face.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.610
All-in Alice.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:18.370
Oh, right. I have a question about 
the recording this weekend, too.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.090
Yuzu, can I talk to you about it later?

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:23.620
Huh? S-Sure, of course.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.630
Thanks.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:30.550
So anyway, I want to try 
singing like a canary.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.130
She really is smiling a lot.

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:33.800
Yeah.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.430
I hope she can smile like that all the time.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:43.890
I wonder what kind of man he is,
to change her that much.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.340
I'm kind of interested!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.090
Well, I'm sure I'll never have 
the chance to find out.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.530
So without knowing he was 
Momo, your rival in love,

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.790
you got all close to one another.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.210
What were you thinking?!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.750
That's what I want to ask!

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:08.350
Now that I've talked about it, I'm pissed!

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:11.190
I'll delete his address and his 
messages and everything...

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:17.970
It looks he's struggling with whether or 
not he should delete his boyfriend's data.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.100
Goodness, you're right.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:22.220
Wait a sec! Why "boyfriend"? 
It would be my girlfriend!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.100
That's not the part that should bother you...

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:26.350
Anyway...

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.870
I decided today.

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:33.700
No matter how heartbroken I feel, 
I won't run away. I'll be Alice's friend.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.360
I'll protect her smile.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.380
I'll definitely protect it!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.870
Best of luck, Yuzu!

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.470
<i>Good. I can sing this.</i>

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.380
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.840
Wow!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.750
We're going to record here?

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:58.470
Wow!

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.850
I get to sing here?

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:04.680
This is great! This space is just great!

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:08.190
She's just like Miou-chan the 
first time she came here.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.240
You're right.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:11.800
Let's go through the full song first.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:12.360
Sure!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.180
<i>Fly!</i>

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.350
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep, I sing</i>

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.530
<i>I'm nothing more than a canary</i>

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:43.570
<i>Drowning in sweet, glistening lies</i>

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:42.260
<i>I'm so relieved to have work to do.</i>

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.720
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep, I peck</i>

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:46.940
Looking good.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.070
<i>I'm not afraid of anything</i>

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.630
She can hold her notes a lot longer now.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:50.900
Of course she can.

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:53.930
<i>I sleep in the depths of sweet nectar</i>

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.360
She's studied and practiced a whole lot.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:59.950
<i>When I sing, that alone makes me wonderful</i>

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:59.950
<i>I felt like it'd come true 
if I put it into words.</i>

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.560
<i>So let me stay here in this cage</i>

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.570
<i>I don't want to say anything.</i>

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:04.460
<i>I don't want to see anything.</i>

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:10.070
<i>When I shout, that alone makes me invincible</i>

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:09.450
<i>If I just sing...</i>

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:14.280
<i>So please don't open this cage</i>

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:18.870
<i>I'll fall</i>

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:17.080
<i>Sing.</i>

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.460
<i>Sing.</i>

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:25.230
<i>Straight down</i>

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.350
<i>Sing.</i>

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:30.320
<i>I'm being swallowed by waves 
of what is real and empty</i>

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:30.850
<i>From morning to night,</i>

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:35.650
<i>My chocolate, milk, candy, and 
everything else is being taken away</i>

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.680
<i>like a singing canary in a cage.</i>

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.990
<i>Neither happiness nor sadness will get inside.</i>

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.700
<i>All that's inside is sweet 
feelings and memories.</i>

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:49.020
<i>As I'm carried away by the flow, I awaken</i>

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:51.620
<i>Not a trace of the reality of 
the future can be found inside.</i>

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:51.320
<i>My name is Canary</i>

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.290
<i>All the sweet lies are empty</i>

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:55.560
<i>That's why it's not scared of anything.</i>

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:58.660
<i>As long as it sings, there's nothing to fear.</i>

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.390
<i>As I'm carried away by the flow, I am plucked</i>

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:01.590
<i>And now I'm left with no more feathers</i>

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:00.840
<i>But then, one day...</i>

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:06.620
<i>I fall deeper into the depths of 
the sweet darkness of the night</i>

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.180
<i>Suddenly, the door is opened.</i>

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:10.640
<i>Anxiety and reality sweep over 
the canary like a torrent,</i>

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:12.310
<i>I would have been fine if I had 
just averted my eyes from reality</i>

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.900
<i>and in an instant, everything is torn away,</i>

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:16.400
<i>That was why I was in this cage</i>

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.940
<i>and the canary is left naked.</i>

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:22.990
<i>So don't do anything uncalled for</i>

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.440
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:22.660
<i>These lyrics...</i>

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:26.700
<i>I'll sing wherever I am</i>

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:26.000
<i>They're just like me!</i>

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:34.270
<i>Fly high!</i>

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:40.450
<i>Even if the spell is broken</i>

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:45.930
<i>It's all garbage to my wet claws, and I laugh</i>

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:50.950
<i>Kicking out all my gummies, tarts, and cream</i>

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:02.420
<i>Fly away right now!</i>

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:04.470
Nino.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.170
Wait. Don't say anything.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.480
Right now...

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:08.800
Don't say it, Momo.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.790
...there's someone I like.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:16.020
Alice!

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:22.530
Alice, what's wrong?

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.050
What happened?

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:28.550
M-Momo told me that he used to like me.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:33.250
That he liked me six years ago,

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:36.810
but now there's someone else he likes.

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:40.150
I'm... I'm so stupid.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:44.320
I believed that Momo still liked me.

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:48.320
That he wanted to see me just like 
I wanted to see him for these six years.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:54.580
That he felt the same as me, that he went 
about things at the same pace as me.

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:57.330
I selfishly believed that.

00:21:58.140 --> 00:22:01.090
That's why I was fine, no matter 
how much he refused me.

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:03.350
Because somewhere inside,

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:05.340
I believed that.

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:07.280
Aren't I stupid?

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:09.400
I must have been dreaming.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:12.380
There's no way it could be true!

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:15.240
Alice!

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:16.200
Yuzu...

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:17.340
Alice!

00:22:17.340 --> 00:22:19.190
I lied to him.

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:21.770
I told him I only used to like him, too.

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:24.400
Even though I still do!

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:25.280
Alice!

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:27.550
Even though I still like him!

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.560
Now I can never tell him.

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.670
Alice, sing!

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:30.910
Sing, Alice!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:33.410
<i>I've already decided.</i>

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:34.450
Alice!

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:36.040
<i>No matter how much time it takes...</i>

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:36.410
Alice!

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:38.790
<i>I will be your friend.</i>

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:42.300
<i>I swear</i>

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:44.920
<i>I will.</i>

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:52.280
♭09 
And So, We Took Off Running for That Summer
